Description: safe Rust bindings for DTK6 widgets
 This crate provides non-owning, safe Rust wrappers for DTK6 and Qt6 widget
 types.  It includes generated wrappers for DTK controls as well as helpers
 for signals, event callbacks, custom painting, layouts and value types.
 .
 This package contains the Rust source for the dtk crate, for use with cargo.

