 librust-dtk-sys-0.1.0-dev (= ${binary:Version}),
Description: low-level Rust FFI bindings for DTK6 widgets
 This crate provides the cxx bridge and C++ shim used to call DTK6 and Qt6
 widget APIs from Rust.  Its build script discovers the native libraries with
 pkg-config, generates cxx bridge code and runs the Qt6 meta-object compiler.
 .
 This package contains the Rust and C++ source for the dtk-sys crate, for use
 with cargo.
